### Omint Assistance — B2B CreateQuotationB2B (crudo)
### Auth: OAuth2 Client Credentials → luego Bearer en /Quotation/CreateQuotationB2B
### Ambiente: PRODUCCIÓN (TEST Azure no valida el token — OpenIddict ID2170)
###
### Flujo:
###   1) Corré "get token"
###   2) Copiá access_token a @access_token (o usá {{getToken.response.body.access_token}})
###   3) Cotizá
###
### Destinos (destination_id app → destinationCode Omint):
###   1 Nacional → ARG | 2 Latam → ASU | 3 Europa → EMO
###   4 Resto mundo → MUC | 5 Norteamérica → NAC
### productTypeCode: S=Simple | A=Anual/Multiviaje | L=Larga estadía
### tariffTypeCode: B=Bruto | quantityOfDays (anual): 30 | 45 | 60

@token_url = https://core.omintassistance.com.ar/connect/token
@quote_url = https://api.omintassistance.com.ar/Quotation/CreateQuotationB2B
# TEST (no usable por ahora):
# @quote_url = https://oaapp.eastus2.cloudapp.azure.com:8448/Quotation/CreateQuotationB2B

@client_id = d726211e-5dee-4421-8692-242a66c3882b
@client_secret = 10c3dd8387cd101faa159558d8540cc9
@scope = OACoreApi IntegrationWebApi

@agreement_number = 3308
@market_id = 2e455727-2099-469e-9e5d-a01a85072b1b
@email = info@biantravel.com

# Pegá acá el access_token de "get token" (vence en ~60 min)
@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IlVEWi1YLVBPU0VXV0FDSzFPVzRFR0ZCRE5UTEZZQjcxQzlCRTJKVlMiLCJ0eXAiOiJhdCtqd3QifQ..VMYDgx2-95PXd-RyO2dFJNBgTKO42Ynm471RhL6P7u6xNIpejUE2_bsT62Byh58ebqdg5L3d35pvCEdP51W6qYfhBTpx4lxkWkVJxsCE0OkHxW2c88W96ra8gh8WZ7dHvOLKS_2M3ieJE_0s2PxNZ1KmAVhxRzRpIKQtXg7XGI5j6ziErkDSKfeWzeCSuZ6edf3DPQHbI4rTX1M1k9hrUNuZBBJgfczxb5BYapjF4rGZGZSf0J3ZzQF0xWGg85kMut8170xir5c5UJGNh2zSr6i4kqJRKCsg2IkOdvl-efsCS8E0kotDtKTKijz6AUeNRv_Wa5Gi7z7S889JKzfylw


### 1) get token (OAuth2 Client Credentials)
# @name getToken
POST {{token_url}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{client_id}}&client_secret={{client_secret}}&scope={{scope}}

### 2) Cotizar — viaje único Europa (EMO) — como el provider
POST {{quote_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productTypeCode": "S",
  "tariffTypeCode": "B",
  "departureCode": "MAA",
  "destinationCode": "EMO",
  "dateSince": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z",
  "dateUntil": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z",
  "passengerAges": [30, 28],
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

